title: "Penumbra: self-hosted deep retrieval for AI agents"
abstract: "A self-hosted deep-retrieval MCP server that reaches beyond the search surface into the half-lit zone where knowledge is real but invisible to plain search (multi-modal, multi-lingual, walled, and temporal), equipping an AI agent with structured, source-traced evidence."
